{"page":124,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:96","surah":5,"ayah":96,"ar_uthmani":"أُحِلَّ لَكُمْ صَيْدُ ٱلْبَحْرِ وَطَعَامُهُۥ مَتَـٰعًا لَّكُمْ وَلِلسَّيَّارَةِ ۖ وَحُرِّمَ عَلَيْكُمْ صَيْدُ ٱلْبَرِّ مَا دُمْتُمْ حُرُمًا ۗ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ ٱلَّذِىٓ إِلَيْهِ تُحْشَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is permitted for you to catch and eat seafood- an enjoyment for you and the traveller- but hunting game is forbidden while you are in the state of consecration [for pilgrimage]. Be mindful of God to whom you will be gathered.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُحِلَّ","en_gloss":"Is made lawful","transliteration":"uḥilla","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":3,"ar":"صَيْدُ","en_gloss":"game","transliteration":"ṣaydu","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْبَحْرِ","en_gloss":"(of) the sea","transliteration":"l-baḥri","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَطَعَامُهُۥ","en_gloss":"and its food","transliteration":"waṭaʿāmuhu","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَتَـٰعًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) provision","transliteration":"matāʿan","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلِلسَّيَّارَةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"and for the travelers","transliteration":"walilssayyārati","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَحُرِّمَ","en_gloss":"and is made unlawful","transliteration":"waḥurrima","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"on you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":11,"ar":"صَيْدُ","en_gloss":"game","transliteration":"ṣaydu","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْبَرِّ","en_gloss":"(of) the land","transliteration":"l-bari","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":14,"ar":"دُمْتُمْ","en_gloss":"long as you","transliteration":"dum'tum","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":15,"ar":"حُرُمًۭا ۗ","en_gloss":"(are in) Ihram","transliteration":"ḥuruman","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"And be conscious","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"the One","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":19,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":20,"ar":"تُحْشَرُونَ","en_gloss":"you will be gathered","transliteration":"tuḥ'sharūna","verse_key":"5:96"},{"pos":21,"ar":"٩٦","en_gloss":"(96)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:96"}]},{"verse_key":"5:97","surah":5,"ayah":97,"ar_uthmani":"۞ جَعَلَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْكَعْبَةَ ٱلْبَيْتَ ٱلْحَرَامَ قِيَـٰمًا لِّلنَّاسِ وَٱلشَّهْرَ ٱلْحَرَامَ وَٱلْهَدْىَ وَٱلْقَلَـٰٓئِدَ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ لِتَعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَعْلَمُ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God has made the Ka'ba- the Sacred House- a means of support for people, and the Sacred Months, the animals for sacrifice and their garlands: all this. Know that God has knowledge of all that is in the heavens and earth and that He is fully aware of all things.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"Has (been) made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"5:97"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:97"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكَعْبَةَ","en_gloss":"the Kabah","transliteration":"l-kaʿbata","verse_key":"5:97"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْبَيْتَ","en_gloss":"the House","transliteration":"l-bayta","verse_key":"5:97"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْحَرَامَ","en_gloss":"the Sacred","transliteration":"l-ḥarāma","verse_key":"5:97"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قِيَـٰمًۭا","en_gloss":"an establishment","transliteration":"qiyāman","verse_key":"5:97"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِّلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for mankind","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"5:97"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلشَّهْرَ","en_gloss":"and the month(s)","transliteration":"wal-shah